sional recommendation for C. Or we could propose that given the lack of stress data, we cannot consider A as strong alternative.\n\nThus our public message: I note that we have no stress resilience data for A, which is a critical criterion, so we cannot elevate A over C. I maintain recommendation for C but suggest we ask for stress resilience info for A and maybe B, D.\n\nWe need to include vote: Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
